title — The primary brand or heading text displayed on the header; "Moka Mola" (default).

subtitle — Secondary badge text displayed next to the title; "CAFE" (default).

activeTable — The identifier label shown next to the QR scanner icon; "Table" (default).

totalItemCount — The numeric counter value displayed inside the shopping bag badge; 0 (default).